From 6251e540aac6912a41edbaed9136960c2c06f102 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:13:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): viewport bottom control bar holds the view
 buttons

The five view buttons that stacked under the view cube (frame, iso,
shaded/wireframe, toolpaths, world axes) move into a rounded, grey
ribbon floating over the bottom edge of the 3D viewport. The cube stays
top-right. The ribbon and its glyphs move to viewport_bar.rs; the buttons
keep their effects.

Refs #1198
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
