 empty-document line give way

The maintainer refused the bottom-left placement ("it should have been
bottom-center floating ontop of the 3D viewer"). The ribbon is centred on
the bottom edge again. One pure layout (viewport_layout::place) places the
ribbon, the control legend and the empty-document line from the pane, the
view cube and the frame-measured text sizes: the legend lifts onto its own
line above the ribbon where it would meet it, the empty-document line lifts
above the ribbon and the legend, and a piece that would meet the cube or
leave the pane is not drawn. Text wraps to the pane at the hud's minimum.

